WEBVTT

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:25.220
to you to say what's next.

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:31.980
How about how to keep track of things?

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:33.710
Okay.

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:37.260
The horse is ready.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:38.100
Si, senor.

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:46.920
Nobles.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:54.080
Says, who are you calling?

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:54.950
James.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.920
I thought I'd call him and tell him about our good luck in getting the supplies.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:05:59.400
We'll call him later.

00:05:59.780 --> 00:05:59.980
Right.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.460
now I want to keep this line open for business. I'm expecting

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.440
a call from Senior Laird. All right.

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.280
Hello, Brad. Can you hear me?

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:21.050
Yeah. What am I on? You're crossed

00:06:21.050 --> 00:06:22.990
up with the office. Now all you've got to do is

00:06:22.990 --> 00:06:29.590
listen. Alert a property.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:32.080
I expect to have a quit-claim deed this afternoon.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:33.740
Be ready to run your lines in the morning.

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:41.940
So?

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:43.930
Oh, Senor Lerda.

00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:47.560
Deeds are ready.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.300
Everything is signed, sealed, and in good order.

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:51.690
Well, that's fine.

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:53.750
Well, thank you very much.

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:55.690
I'll send for them right away.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:56.460
Goodbye.

00:06:57.440 --> 00:06:57.980
We got it.

00:06:59.650 --> 00:06:59.910
I'm ready.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:02.710
You know, those deeds are pretty important.

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:03.970
I'd better go after them myself.

00:07:04.740 --> 00:07:05.280
Want to go along?

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:06.300
I'd love to.

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:30.250
Thank you.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:28.100
Years ago, Zorro was a good friend to Mexico.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:29.970
I do not...

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.360
understand how the same Zorro...

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.960
Zorro is a legend, and

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:36.170
legends never die. Please hurry,

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:37.410
senor. Time is short.

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:11.870
no longer ride El Rey. El Rey was killed. But, senor, you said legends never die. You

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:18.940
mean you think not Zorro? I wish the truth. Watch this.

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:04.890
He's got the paper! One of you men stay here.

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:30.760
You wait for your phone.

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:55.740
I can't keep watch.

00:10:58.490 --> 00:10:59.450
Give me those papers.

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:01.200
I have got no papers.

00:11:01.930 --> 00:11:02.110
No?

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:04.700
All right, we'll find out.

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:05.850
Get off that horse.

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:07.660
Bring your own papers.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:26.840
Please, senor, I do not know.

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:29.560
Where are they?

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:29.970
Just...

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:30.400
Thank you.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:29.530
I know you.

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:43.200
I have a picture, Mr. Lerda Francho.

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:57.840
I'll give you all.

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:58.240
Yes, sir.

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:47.710
Who did this?

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:52.380
My property is gone.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:53.480
I don't care about that.

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:54.180
Who did this to you?

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:57.690
Zorro.

00:13:59.280 --> 00:13:59.500
Buster.

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:10.830
What are we going to do?

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:13.380
We're going to call the Ruralis.

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:24.730
Ruralis headquarters?

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:26.600
This is Philip Andrews speaking.

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:28.740
Senor Lead has been murdered.

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:29.980
Senor Lead has been murdered.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.420
that at once.

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:32.460
I gave him to Zorro.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.860
And Zorro still has him.

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:59.970
We thought you'd catch a lot.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:06.620
Without you, maybe now we see your face.
